            <span class="mt-0.5 block text-xs leading-relaxed text-text-tertiary">A PDF, a photo of the report as JPG, PNG or WebP, or the JSON your Verve app exports &middot; up to 15 MB each &middot; several at once &middot; originals stay in your private archive &middot; a file you already have is spotted before it is filed</span>
          </span>
